Subject: Disable raw sigsegv stack-overflow recovery under __FILC__
Policy-Class: P2-Package
Rationale: Gnulib's raw sigsegv stack-overflow recovery inspects low-level signal frames unsupported under Fil-C's memory-safe runtime; disabling it under __FILC__ matches ports/grep and ports/m4.
Upstream-Status: Fil-C-Specific
Fil-C-Origin-Commits: 8553fcd026b9

--- a/lib/sigsegv.c
+++ b/lib/sigsegv.c
@@ -1417,7 +1417,7 @@
 stackoverflow_install_handler (stackoverflow_handler_t handler,
                                void *extra_stack, size_t extra_stack_size)
 {
-#if HAVE_STACK_OVERFLOW_RECOVERY
+#if HAVE_STACK_OVERFLOW_RECOVERY && !defined(__FILC__)
 # if HAVE_STACKVMA
   if (!stack_top)
     {
